      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan watches a large scale auction from a private room in Shang clan city that his purple thorn token grants. The host puts up flame heart Gu at a starting bid of thirty thousand primeval stones, naming the miniature volcano shape, the heart residence after refining, and the strengthening of fire type Gu worm attacks. Bidding climbs from thirty-five thousand and stops at forty-two thousand; Fang Yuan, watching from the private room, calls that a reasonable price. Frost breath Gu and flame heart Gu sold for about thirty to forty thousand, low next to other goods at that auction.",
